{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39573","headline":"华下霁後晓眺 · 翁承赞","name":"华下霁後晓眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结茅幽寂近禅林，霁景烟光着柳阴。\n千嶂华山云外秀，万重乡思望中深。\n老嫌白发还偷镊，贫对春风亦强吟。\n花畔水边人不会，腾腾闲步一披襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}